#. あ、葉隠クン…！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Hiro!"
msgstr ""

#. …うおッ！！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Gwah!"
msgstr ""

#. な、な、苗木っち！！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "M-M-Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. さっきからどうしたの？
#. 話しかける度に驚いて…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What's going on with you? Every time I see you, you\n"
"freak out like that."
msgstr ""

#. い、いやぁ……
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No, I..."
msgstr "K-Không, tớ..."

#. いやぁ！！
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "Không phải!"

#. 悪いけど、俺は急いでるんだって！！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Sorry, but I'm in a big hurry!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは逃げるように
#. 走り去っていった…けど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once again, he ran off like a terrified rabbit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クン…どうして…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro...what's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカールームのノートの件も、
#. まだ確認出来てないって言うのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still wasn't able to talk to him about the notebook\n"
"I'd found.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで逃げるように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was like he was avoiding me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるでボクを避けるみたいに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Like he was afraid of me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…だよ……
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why...?"
msgstr "Tại sao...?"

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là một trong những chiếc màn hình mà Monokuma\n"
"hay xuất hiện.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hiện tại nó chỉ đang hiển thị huy hiệu của trường.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…変な顔でもしてやろうかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should start making stupid faces at this\n"
"thing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、きっと後でネタにされるだけだ。
#. やめておこう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Better not. They might save it and laugh at me later.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>物置には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking in the toolshed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ごちゃごちゃとと物が詰め込まれている。
#. 芝刈り機に植木鉢…肥料やら農具やら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Stuff's been shoved everywhere. From a lawnmower to\n"
"fertilizer, flowerpots to farm tools...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ニワトリは…４羽に減ったままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are still just the four chickens left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>元通りに増えたら…
#. 逆に怖いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Honestly, I'd be kinda terrified if there were more\n"
"than that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマフラワーか…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The Monokuma Flower..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴミでもプラスチックでも人間でも食べるって…
#. 本当なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it true...? Does it really eat paper, plastic, and\n"
"people?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có thật không...? Nó thực sự ăn được cả giấy, nhựa, và con\n"
"người luôn sao?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…事件には関係なさそうだし
#. この花には近付かない方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think it's related to the case, so I'd\n"
"better keep my distance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>スプリンクラーの制御パネルだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sprinkler control panel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>毎朝７時３０分にスプリンクラーが作動する設定で、
#. 設定の変更も不可能だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're set to turn on at 7:30 every morning. And\n"
"Monokuma said the time positively couldn't be changed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>天井の…あの突起物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those nozzles poking out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Những cái vòi nhô ra kia...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. あれは…スプリンクラーか…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are those...the sprinklers?"
msgstr "Đó có phải là... vòi phun nước không nhỉ?"

#. はい
msgctxt "0029 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
